{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Pipewell for breadth, or Northwind CRM if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50de-702b-9cf6-c5685c39801a","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:27.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm slack integration deal alerts","crm gmail integration best","sales tools slack gmail"],"latency_ms":5350,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[142,150],[452,460]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[251,264],[477,490]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[362,375]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sen